<title>UK: SOCCER-VEGA ON WAY TO TOTTENHAM.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VEGA ON WAY TO TOTTENHAM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss international defender Ramon Vega was poised to complete a reported three million pounds ($5.1 million) transfer to Tottenham Hotspur from Cagliari on Tuesday, subject to a medical examination.</p>
<p>&quot;In the past year, England has become a Bosman hotel, attracting very good international players -- and I want to be part of it,&quot; said Vega, who has agreed a 3-1/2 years contract.</p>
</text>
